[00:13.34]1. Sarah and Esther, Mary, Ruth, and others—
[00:21.60]All these were capable women, loyal wives.
[00:29.76]Godly devotion was foremost in their lives.
[00:37.34]They were faithful women, ones we know by name.
[00:45.50]There were others favored by Jehovah;
[00:52.26]Nameless in the record, their faith was just the same.
[00:58.17]2. Goodness and courage, loyal love and kindness—
[01:06.33]Lovable qualities in all humankind,
[01:14.49]Virtues these excellent women bring to mind.
[01:21.49]They were fine examples we appreciate.
[01:30.24]In the same way now our Christian sisters
[01:36.24]Show a faithful spirit we all can imitate.
[01:47.04]3. Mothers and daughters, sisters, wives, and widows,
[01:54.54]Willingly laboring, glad to do your part.
[02:06.20]Modest your bearing, submissive is your heart,
[02:12.84]Having God’s approval, may you never fear.
[02:19.10]Christian sisters, may Jehovah keep you
[02:23.22]Firm in your conviction, your prize is drawing near.